        "created_at": "2012-09-27T05:49:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wait a second, I checked her bio a while ago, and I can swear it said she was 28, which I was really surprised at. I took for for being 18-19. But now it says she's 19 on the bio. Was I imaging things? At least I know I wasn't way off on the age. So Visionary is still the only minor of the heroes. Though I thought Visionary to be older. Dakota and I had a contest to see who could most closely guess the heroes' ages.</p>",
